{"key": "c0cc13155e586a1328e06b616d5e8f2afe296f3a1988359fe53da11f92bd7b88", "value": {"response": "```python\ndef add(lst):\n    \"\"\"Given a non-empty list of integers lst. add the even elements that are at odd indices.\n    \n    Examples:\n        add([4, 2, 6, 7]) ==> 2 \n    \"\"\"\n    return sum([x for i, x in enumerate(lst) if i % 2 != 0 and x % 2 == 0])\n```", "prompt_eval_count": 770, "eval_count": 84}}
